The harm is that the FBI will not continue to offer the general
public access to its e-mail account if the general public
fills that account with gratuitous postings and specious legal
reasoning.  You are, after all, staking a claim on U.S. government
resources, however incremental, and are, in the final analysis,
wasting the government's time unless your have a bona fide complaint.

