Here's what this moderator would have to do:  He'd have to decode each
picture, examine it, and track down the people in it to ensure they
had signed model releases.  Or, he'd have to get such releases from
the submitter.  He'd also have to make sure that the picture wasn't
actually owned by Playboy, Penthouse, Hustler, or one of the many
smaller 'skin' magazines.  Don't forget the photography magazines,
